---
import PDFviewer from "../components/PDFviewer.astro"
---
<section
  id="contact"
  class="min-h-screen bg-background flex flex-col justify-center items-center pt-20"
>
  <div
    class="timeline-view animate-blurred-fade-in animate-range-[entry_0%_contain_20%]"
  >
    What's next?
  </h2>
  <p
    class="mx-6 text-primary text-md md:text-xl font-primary text-justify prose"
  >
    I’m ready to take on new challenges where I can create scalable,
    user-focused applications and continue growing as a frontend developer.
    Whether it's collaborating with a team or building impactful products, I’m
    excited about what comes next.
    <br />
    Feel free to download my resume in English or Spanish below.
  </p>
  <div>
    <div class="block lg:hidden my-10">
      <button>
        <a
          href="/docs/curriculum-vitae.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          class="px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-accent text-surface font-semibold transition hover:scale-105"
        >
          Download ES
        </a>
      </button>

      <button>
        <a
          href="/docs/cv-eng.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          class="px-5 py-2 rounded-full border border-accent text-accent font-semibold transition hover:scale-105"
        >
          Download EN
        </a>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full my-10 hidden lg:block">
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <button
          id="btn-es"
          class="px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-accent text-surface font-semibold transition hover:scale-105"
        >
          Español
        </button>

        <button
          id="btn-en"
          class="px-5 py-2 rounded-full border border-accent text-accent font-semibold transition hover:scale-105"
        >
          English
        </button>
      </div>
      <div
        id="pdf-viewer"
        class="w-200 h-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-border"
      >
      </div>
      <PDFviewer client:visible/>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>